# All @word content is taken verbatim from the Quizlet flashcards.
# This set is a verb-only review; the source has no example sentences.

@lesson A1.09 "Verbs Review"

# --- Action verbs (Quizlet cards 1-13, 19) ---
@word schwätzen = to talk, to speak
@word ginn = to give
@word hunn = to have
@word sinn = to be
@word wunnen = to live, to reside
@word heeschen = to be called
@word bréngen = to bring
@word spillen = to play
@word schaffen = to work
@word kommen = to come
@word maachen = to make/to do
@word goen = to go
@word fueren = to drive
@word huelen = to take

# --- Modal verbs (Quizlet cards 14-18) ---
@word mussen = must/have to
@word kënnen = can
@word wëllen = to want
@word sollen = should
@word däerfen = to be allowed to
